# Build and dependency noise
node_modules/
*.tsbuildinfo

# Local runtime data: room databases, backups, probe reports
.project-room-data/
*.sqlite
*.sqlite-journal
*.sqlite-wal
*.sqlite-shm
_probe/probe-report.json

# Sandbox ACL diagnostics. Written by a repair tool when a confined write is
# denied: it names this machine's absolute paths, its DACL and the user's SID.
# One such run was committed by accident and had to be removed from history —
# this line is what keeps the next one out.
.dsh-acl-reports/

# Scratch and editor noise
.tmp/
*.log
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Packed release artifact (`npm run pack`): reproducible from the tree, never committed.
*.tgz

# Captured verification output. Kept OUT of `notes/` on purpose: `notes/` is in the
# manifest's `files` list, so writing a record there changes what the package
# promises and makes the tarball stale the moment the record is written — which is
# exactly what happened, and what the "missing nothing the manifest promises" check
# caught. Local, timestamped evidence belongs beside `.tmp/`, not inside the package.
.evidence/
